<!-- PROBLEM SECTION -->
<section class="section problem" id="cost" style="scroll-margin-top: 62px;">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="problem-grid">

      <!-- LEFT: heading + sub + 3 inline stats -->
      <div>
        <div class="section-label">The cost</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Microsoft licensing is<br class="mobile-only-br"> complex<br class="desktop-br"> by design.<br class="mobile-only-br"> <em>That cost is real.</em></h2>
        <p class="section-sub">EA renewals, NCE transitions, and hybrid cloud exposure mean most organisations walk into these conversations without a clear position. The result is overpayment and leverage on Microsoft's side of the table.</p>

        <!-- 3 stats in a row -->
        <div class="problem-stats-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;border-top:0.5px solid rgba(30,18,6,0.12);margin-top:28px;">
          <div class="pstat-cell" style="border-right:0.5px solid rgba(30,18,6,0.12);">
            <div class="insight-card-num" style="text-align:center;">400+</div>
            <div class="pstat-label" style="text-align:center;">Licensable SKUs in<br>Microsoft's catalog</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pstat-cell" style="border-right:0.5px solid rgba(30,18,6,0.12);">
            <div class="insight-card-num" style="text-align:center;">±7 weeks</div>
            <div class="pstat-label" style="text-align:center;">Lost on a manual<br>server assessment</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pstat-cell">
            <div class="insight-card-num" style="text-align:center;">90 days</div>
            <div class="pstat-label" style="text-align:center;">Official Microsoft<br>reassignment rule</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:rgba(30,18,6,0.55);line-height:1.7;font-style:italic;border-left:2px solid #D97706;padding-left:14px;margin-top:28px;">Our strength isn't the rules alone. It's the auditable trail from raw inventory to Bill of Materials. Benchmarks are interesting. Evidence is actionable.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT: 3 problem points in white card -->
      <div class="problem-right">
        <div style="background:#fff;border:0.5px solid rgba(30,18,6,0.1);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;">
          <div class="problem-point" style="border-top:none;">
            <div class="pp-num">01</div>
            <div class="pp-text">
              <div class="pp-title">No single source of truth</div>
              <div class="pp-body">Inventory lives in RVTools exports, MAP Toolkit outputs, spreadsheets, and SCCM. Nobody has the full picture going into renewal.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="problem-point">
            <div class="pp-num">02</div>
            <div class="pp-text">
              <div class="pp-title">Assessments often take weeks to months to build</div>
              <div class="pp-body">Every report is hand-crafted. By the time it's done, the data is already stale and the conversation has started.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="problem-point" style="border-bottom:none;">
            <div class="pp-num">03</div>
            <div class="pp-text">
              <div class="pp-title">M365 over-provisioning goes undetected</div>
              <div class="pp-body">E5 licences assigned to users who never open Power BI, never use the phone system, never trigger a DLP policy. That gap compounds every month.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- AUDIENCE SECTION -->
<section id="audience" style="scroll-margin-top: 62px; background:#131e1f;border-top:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.2);border-bottom:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.2);padding:72px 2rem;">
  <div style="max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div style="margin-bottom:52px;">
      <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-light);margin-bottom:14px;">Who it's for</div>
      <h2 class="nowrap-title audience-title" style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:clamp(32px,3.5vw,36px);font-weight:300;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#f0f5f5;max-width:1040px;">
        One platform. Three kinds of <em style="font-style:italic;color:#86CCE0;">licensing challenges.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Three cards -->
    <div class="audience-3col" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">

      <!-- Enterprise IT & Finance -->
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.22);border-radius:14px;padding:32px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:4px;">
          <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;background:rgba(61,122,128,0.14);border:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
              <rect x="2" y="5" width="16" height="11" rx="2" stroke="#86CCE0" stroke-width="1.4"/>
              <path d="M6 9h8M6 12h5" stroke="#86CCE0" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M7 5V4a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 011 1v1" stroke="#86CCE0" stroke-width="1.4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#f0f5f5;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">Enterprise IT &amp; Finance</div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-light);margin-top:3px;">End clients</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:rgba(240,245,245,0.65);line-height:1.7;margin:0;">You're the buyer. Before your next Microsoft contract or subscription renewal, Toolify gives you a clear, independent picture of what you actually own, what's actually in use, and where you're overpaying, in plain terms, whether you think in servers or in spend.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px;border-top:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.15);">
          <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#86CCE0;">No more surprises at renewal →</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Microsoft Partners -->
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.22);border-radius:14px;padding:32px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:4px;">
          <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;background:rgba(61,122,128,0.14);border:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
              <path d="M10 2L17 6V14L10 18L3 14V6L10 2Z" stroke="#86CCE0" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <path d="M10 2V18M3 6L17 14M17 6L3 14" stroke="#86CCE0" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.35"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#f0f5f5;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">Microsoft Partners</div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-light);margin-top:3px;">LSPs, MSPs and CSPs</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:rgba(240,245,245,0.65);line-height:1.7;margin:0;">You advise, transact, and manage. Whether you're running EA renewals for enterprise accounts or managing M365 tenants on a recurring basis, Toolify lets you deliver defensible assessments across your entire client portfolio, at scale, without adding headcount.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px;border-top:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.15);">
          <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#86CCE0;">From weeks to hours, per client →</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Licensing consultants -->
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.22);border-radius:14px;padding:32px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:4px;">
          <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;background:rgba(61,122,128,0.14);border:0.5px solid rgba(61,122,128,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
              <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7.5" stroke="#86CCE0" stroke-width="1.4"/>
              <path d="M10 6.5v3.5l2.5 2.5" stroke="#86CCE0" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M6 4.5L4.5 3M14 4.5L15.5 3" stroke="#86CCE0" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#f0f5f5;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">Licensing consultants</div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-light);margin-top:3px;">Independent advisors &amp; boutique firms</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:rgba(240,245,245,0.65);line-height:1.7;margin:0;">Your reputation is built on precision. Toolify's engine calculates every licensing scenario, including virtualization topology, SA status, entitlement delta, and M365 downgrade paths, and produces the audit-ready output your clients expect from a specialist. The credibility is yours.</p>
        </div>
