        <h3>Raw inventory to<br class="mobile-only-br"> <em>audit-ready.</em> In hours.</h3>
        <p class="product-desc">Upload an RVTools export, MAP Toolkit file, or a SOLAR Collector scan. The engine computes your exact Windows Server and SQL Server licensing position, including every virtualization scenario, SA requirement, ESU exposure, and entitlement gap.</p>
        <p class="product-desc">Most of that time isn't spent calculating, it's spent on data quality. With a clean, complete dataset, you can have preliminary results in under 30 minutes. Larger environments or a few manual confirmations can stretch that into a few hours, still a fraction of the weeks a manual audit normally takes.</p>
