        <h3 class="nowrap-title" style="color:var(--text);">Right-size every <em style="color:var(--purple-l)">M365 license.</em> With evidence.</h3>
        <p class="product-desc">Connect your Microsoft tenant via Graph API and T365 analyses license utilization across every user: mailbox size, OneDrive storage, Teams activity, Office app launches, and Power BI usage. The engine categorizes every finding and computes the savings opportunity with a defensible audit trail.</p>
        <div class="product-features">
          <div class="product-feature">
            <div class="feature-check" style="background:rgba(123,94,167,0.15)">
