        <h2 class="section-title">Built by people who've sat on <em>every side of the renewal table.</em></h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Toolify is founded and built by Dennis Toele and Bianca Lueb, who between them bring decades of Microsoft licensing experience inside Microsoft itself, at major resellers including SoftwareOne/Comparex and Insight, and years of independent consulting across organisations from 100 employees to over 100,000.</p>
        <div class="team-quote">
