        <span class="blog-tag">End of support</span>
        <h3 class="blog-title">Windows Server 2016 End of Support: Licensing and Readiness Assessment</h3>
        <p class="blog-excerpt">Windows Server 2016 reaches End of Support on January 12, 2027. Learn about ESU requirements, Software Assurance, Azure Arc, licensing considerations and how an ESU Readiness Assessment can help identify potential impact.</p>
        <div class="blog-meta-row">
          <span class="blog-read-link">Read the post &rarr;</span>
